  "name": "Zul'Gurub: High Priestess Arlokk's Razor Claws bleed keeps the DBC Mythic amount per stack",
  "contract": [
    "The round-6 tester (Mythic): Arlokk's bleed ticks for about 9k. A full Ravage (2118331, 4 hits/s for 10 s)",
    "stacks her Razor Claws bleed to about 40; the Mythic variant 2118328 has 213 per stack (DBC; Normal 2118326",
    "125, Heroic 2118327 169, Ascended 2118329 250) and Aspect of Bethekk (2118323) adds 25 %, so a stack bleeds 266.",
    "The user decided on 2026-11-13 that each difficulty keeps its DBC amount: 213 on Mythic, as its tooltip shows,",
    "and not the Normal 125. Here a warrior hero pulls Arlokk at the Zul'Gurub entrance on Mythic and wounds her below",
    "half health; she vanishes, Ravages him and his bleed stacks past 25. After the Ravage the bleed amount divided",
    "by its stacks must be 213 x 1.25 = 266 (250-280 allows one stack landing between the two reads), not 156."
  ],
